# Planted bugs in the shipping tiers. Each one must make the named check miss its expectation.
run fv-z3 shipping.py
properties TiersAreComplete TiersAreUnique
file shipping.py

mutation tier B's upper bound narrows, leaving a gap before tier C starts
detects TiersAreComplete
-     return And(w >= 500, w < 2_000)
+     return And(w >= 500, w < 1_900)

mutation tier C's lower bound drops into tier B, so the two now overlap
detects TiersAreUnique
-     return And(w >= 2_000, w <= MAX_WEIGHT)
+     return And(w >= 1_900, w <= MAX_WEIGHT)

harmless a comment is reworded
- """Tier A: 0 g up to 500 g."""
+ """Tier A: the lightest packages, up to 500 g."""
